                                rdfs:label "French"@en.
<https://w3id.org/idsa/code/FY> a ids:Language,
                                  <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual>;
                                rdfs:label "Western Frisian"@en.
<https://w3id.org/idsa/code/GA> a ids:Language,
