                                                                       ids:includedCertificationLevel <https://w3id.org/idsa/code/PARTICIPANT_ENTRY_LEVEL_SELF_ASSESSMENT>.
<https://w3id.org/idsa/code/PARTICIPANT_ENTRY_LEVEL_SELF_ASSESSMENT> a ids:ParticipantCertificationLevel,
