ids:Described a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual>,
                <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class>;
              <https://w3id.org/idsa/metamodel/abstract> true;
              <https://w3id.org/idsa/metamodel/validation> [<https://w3id.org/idsa/metamodel/forProperty> ids:description ; 
